{
  "folderName": "LV Database",
  "books": [
    {
      "id": "loads",
      "file": "Loads.xlsx",
      "sheet": "Loads",
      "about": [
        "Your equipment library: one row per item you use repeatedly (light fittings, A/C units, pumps, heaters...).",
        "Name and Power (W) are required. 'Schedule column' links the item to a column of the DEWA load schedule (e.g. LTG, 'S' A/C).",
        "Phases: 1 or 3. Power factor and demand factor are optional (blank = the app's default).",
        "Save the file and the app updates within a second or two. Projects that use an item pick up its new values automatically."
      ],
      "columns": [
        {
          "key": "name",
          "header": "Name",
          "width": 30,
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "category",
          "header": "Category",
          "width": 16,
          "list": [
            "Lighting",
            "Fan",
            "Socket",
            "A/C",
            "Motor",
            "Pump",
            "Water heater",
            "Cooker",
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "column",
          "header": "Schedule column",
          "width": 16,
          "list": [
            "LTG",
            "C.FAN",
            "EX.FAN",
            "SH.S/O",
            "13A S/O",
            "W/H",
            "H/D",
            "COOKER",
            "15A S/O",
            "'W' A/C",
            "'S' A/C",
            "WAT.PUMP",
            "13A T.S/O",
            "FCU",
            "SPUR O/L",
            "ISOL",
            "OTHER"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "watts",
          "header": "Power (W)",
          "width": 12,
          "required": true,
          "number": true
        },
        {
          "key": "pf",
          "header": "Power factor",
          "width": 13,
          "number": true
        },
        {
          "key": "phases",
          "header": "Phases",
          "width": 9,
          "list": [
            "1",
            "3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "demandFactor",
          "header": "Demand factor",
          "width": 14,
          "number": true
        },
        {
          "key": "starting",
          "header": "Starting",
          "width": 14,
          "list": [
            "DOL",
            "Star-delta",
            "Soft starter",
            "VFD",
            "-"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "manufacturer",
          "header": "Manufacturer",
          "width": 18
        },
        {
          "key": "model",
          "header": "Model",
          "width": 18
        },
        {
          "key": "notes",
          "header": "Notes",
          "width": 30
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cables",
      "file": "Cables.xlsx",
      "sheet": "Cables",
      "about": [
        "Cable data used by every calculation: one row per conductor size.",
        "Pre-filled with the app's reference values (Cu/XLPE multicore, free air, 30 °C) - replace them with your manufacturer's datasheet.",
        "R at 20 °C in ohm/km (IEC 60228), reactance X in ohm/km, current rating in A before ambient derating. Rate per m is used for the BOQ.",
        "If this sheet is empty or unreadable the app falls back to its reference values and says so on the Database screen."
      ],
      "columns": [
        {
          "key": "csaMm2",
          "header": "Size (mm²)",
          "width": 12,
          "required": true,
          "number": true
        },
        {
          "key": "rOhmPerKm20C",
          "header": "R at 20 °C (ohm/km)",
          "width": 20,
          "required": true,
          "number": true
        },
        {
          "key": "xOhmPerKm",
          "header": "X (ohm/km)",
          "width": 12,
          "required": true,
          "number": true
        },
        {
          "key": "ampacityA",
          "header": "Current rating (A)",
          "width": 18,
          "required": true,
          "number": true
        },
        {
          "key": "ratePerM",
          "header": "Rate per m",
          "width": 12,
          "number": true
        },
        {
          "key": "notes",
          "header": "Notes",
          "width": 30
        }
      ]
    },
